# Sources: Ervand Abrahamian, Iran Between Two Revolutions, ch. 5,
# pp. 249–267, for Kashani's Beirut banishment and messages to the Majles;
# Fakhreddin Azimi, Iran: The Crisis of Democracy, 1941–1953, chs. 5–6;
# David S. Painter and Gregory Brew, The Struggle for Iran, chs. 1 and 5.
# Mechanical effects are counterfactual.
title: <span class="term term-religious">Ayatollah Abol-Qasem Kashani</span>
