= {!<span class="term term-religious">!}Ayatollah Abol-Qasem Kashani{!</span>!}

[? if attempt_emergency_seen = 0: {!<span class="term term-religious">!}Kashani{!</span>!}
is an independent political counterpart with his own constituency and
objectives. The common electoral protest and later
{!<span class="term term-national-front">!}Front{!</span>!} cooperation have
not yet occurred. ?]
[? if attempt_emergency_seen = 1: {!<span class="term term-religious">!}Kashani{!</span>!} is banished to
Beirut during this campaign. He remains an independent political counterpart
with his own constituency and objectives—not a subordinate member of the
{!<span class="term term-national-front">!}Front's{!</span>!} staff.
Consultations represent messages and work through intermediaries; they do not
place him physically in Tehran. ?]

- @kashani_bazaar
- @kashani_terms
